#: ../../dev-manual/building.rst:766
msgid ""
"During the fetch process in the next step, BitBake gathers the source "
"files and creates tarballs in the directory pointed to by :term:`DL_DIR`."
" See the :term:`BB_GENERATE_MIRROR_TARBALLS` variable for more "
"information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/building.rst:773
msgid ""
"*Populate Your Downloads Directory Without Building:* Use BitBake to "
