":term:`Configuration Fragments <Configuration Fragment>` define top level"
" build configuration features that can be independently enabled and "
"disabled using standard tooling. Such features are made of one or several"
" build configuration statements that are either contained in a fragment "
"file, or are set indirectly using the :term:`Built-in Fragment` "
"mechanism."
