#: ../../dev-manual/creating-fragments.rst:20
msgid ""
":term:`Built-in Fragments <Built-in Fragment>` which can be used to "
"assign a value to a single variable and do not require a separate "
"definition file. They are especially useful when a list of possible "
"values is very long (or infinite)."
