"By default, the configured hostname (i.e. ``/etc/hostname``) in an image "
"is the same as the machine name. For example, if :term:`MACHINE` equals "
"\"qemux86\", the configured hostname written to ``/etc/hostname`` is "
"\"qemux86\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/customizing-images.rst:195
msgid ""
