"tasks-compile`, :ref:`ref-tasks-install`, :ref:`ref-tasks-package`, "
":ref:`do_package_write_* <ref-tasks-package_write_deb>`, and :ref:`ref-"
"tasks-build`. The default task is :ref:`ref-tasks-build` and any tasks on"
" which it depends build first. Some tasks, such as :ref:`ref-tasks-"
"devshell`, are not part of the default build chain. If you wish to run a "
