"already is in :term:`OpenEmbedded-Core (OE-Core)` defaults and "
":term:`Poky` reference distribution)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/debugging.rst:946
msgid ""
"If not, set in your distro :term:`configuration file` or in :ref"
":`structure-build-conf-local.conf`::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/debugging.rst:950
msgid ""
"This distro feature enables the server and client library in "
"``elfutils``, and enables ``debuginfod`` support in clients (at the "
"moment, ``gdb`` and ``binutils``)."
msgstr ""

