"full compiler name such as ``arm-poky-linux-gnueabi-gcc`` instead of just"
" using ``gcc``. The same applies to other applications such as "
"``binutils``, ``libtool`` and so forth. BitBake sets up environment "
"variables such as :term:`CC` to assist applications, such as ``make`` to "
"find the correct tools."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/development-shell.rst:80
msgid ""
"It is also worth noting that ``devshell`` still works over X11 forwarding"
" and similar situations."
