"to by :term:`SRC_URI` in the recipe (e.g. a tarball with the new version "
"number in the name, or as a different revision in the upstream Git "
"repository)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/devtool.rst:783
msgid ""
"A common situation is where third-party software has undergone a revision"
