#: ../../dev-manual/devtool.rst:790
msgid ""
"By default, the ``devtool upgrade`` command extracts source code into the"
" ``sources`` directory in the :ref:`devtool-the-workspace-layer-"
"structure`. If you want the code extracted to any other location, you "
"need to provide the ``srctree`` positional argument with the command as "
