#: ../../dev-manual/devtool.rst:808
msgid ""
"Once ``devtool`` locates the recipe, it uses the :term:`SRC_URI` variable"
" to locate the source code and any local patch files from other "
"developers. The result is that the command sets up the source code, the "
"new version of the recipe, and an append file all within the workspace."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/devtool.rst:823
msgid ""
"*Resolve any Conflicts created by the Upgrade*: Conflicts could happen "
"after upgrading the software to a new version. Conflicts occur if your "
"recipe specifies some patch files in :term:`SRC_URI` that conflict with "
"changes made in the new version of the software. For such cases, you need"
" to resolve the conflicts by editing the source and following the normal "
"``git rebase`` conflict resolution process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/devtool.rst:830
msgid ""
"Before moving onto the next step, be sure to resolve any such conflicts "
"created through use of a newer or different version of the software."
