"You can, of course, also deploy the image you build using the ``devtool "
"build-image`` command to actual hardware. However, ``devtool`` does not "
"provide a specific command that allows you to do this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/devtool.rst:874
msgid ""
"*Finish Your Work With the Recipe*: The ``devtool finish`` command "
"creates any patches corresponding to commits in the local Git repository,"
" moves the new recipe to a more permanent layer, and then resets the "
"recipe so that the recipe is built normally rather than from the "
"workspace."
