msgid "A Closer Look at ``devtool add``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/devtool.rst:908
msgid ""
"The ``devtool add`` command automatically creates a recipe based on the "
"source tree you provide with the command. Currently, the command has "
"support for the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/devtool.rst:912
msgid "Autotools (``autoconf`` and ``automake``)"
