#: ../../dev-manual/devtool.rst:1189
msgid "Finding Logs and Work Files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/devtool.rst:1191
msgid ""
"After the first run of the ``devtool build`` command, recipes that were "
"previously created using the ``devtool add`` command or whose sources "
"were modified using the ``devtool modify`` command contain symbolic links"
" created within the source tree:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/devtool.rst:1196
msgid ""
"``oe-logs``: This link points to the directory in which log files and run"
" scripts for each build step are created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/devtool.rst:1199
msgid ""
"``oe-workdir``: This link points to the temporary work area for the "
"recipe. The following locations under ``oe-workdir`` are particularly "
"useful:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/devtool.rst:1203
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``image/``: Contains all of the files installed during the :ref:`ref-"
"tasks-install` stage. Within a recipe, this directory is referred to by "
"the expression ``${``\\ :term:`D`\\ ``}``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/devtool.rst:1208
msgid ""
"``sysroot-destdir/``: Contains a subset of files installed within :ref"
":`ref-tasks-install` that have been put into the shared sysroot. For more"
" information, see the \":ref:`dev-manual/new-recipe:sharing files between"
" recipes`\" section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/devtool.rst:1213
msgid ""
"``packages-split/``: Contains subdirectories for each package produced by"
