#: ../../dev-manual/layers.rst:114
msgid ""
":term:`BBFILE_PATTERN`: Expands immediately during parsing to provide the"
" directory of the layer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/layers.rst:117
msgid ""
":term:`BBFILE_PRIORITY`: Establishes a priority to use for recipes in the"
" layer when the :term:`OpenEmbedded Build System` finds recipes of the "
"same name in different layers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/layers.rst:121
msgid ""
":term:`LAYERVERSION`: Establishes a version number for the layer. You can"
