"layer that has a higher priority to take precedence."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/layers.rst:698
msgid ""
"Also, the layer priority does not currently affect the precedence order "
"of ``.conf`` or ``.bbclass`` files. Future versions of BitBake might "
"address this."
msgstr ""

