#: ../../dev-manual/libraries.rst:86
msgid ""
"User-specific requirements drive the Multilib feature. Consequently, "
"there is no one \"out-of-the-box\" configuration that would meet your "
"needs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dev-manual/libraries.rst:90
msgid ""
"In order to enable Multilib, you first need to ensure your recipe is "
"extended to support multiple libraries. Many standard recipes are already"
" extended and support multiple libraries. You can check in the "
"``meta/conf/multilib.conf`` configuration file in :term:`OpenEmbedded-"
"Core (OE-Core)` to see how this is done using the :term:`BBCLASSEXTEND` "
"variable. Eventually, all recipes will be covered and this list will not "
"be needed."
