#: ../../dev-manual/new-recipe.rst:1431
msgid ""
"When writing recipes, it is good to conform to existing style guidelines."
" See the \":doc:`/contributor-guide/recipe-style-guide`\" in the Yocto "
"Project and OpenEmbedded Contributor Guide for reference."
