"existing variables. This operator does not add any additional space. "
"Also, the operator is applied after all the ``+=``, and ``=+`` operators "
"have been applied and after all ``=`` assignments have occurred. This "
"means that if ``:append`` is used in a recipe, it can only be overridden "
"by another layer using the special ``:remove`` operator, which in turn "
"will prevent further layers from adding it back."
