"typically based on how the recipe is being built. For example, to set the"
" :term:`KBRANCH` variable's value to \"standard/base\" for any target "
":term:`MACHINE`, except for qemuarm where it should be set to \"standard"
"/arm-versatile-926ejs\", you would do the following::"
