#: ../../dev-manual/new-recipe.rst:1640
msgid ""
"Overrides are also used to separate alternate values of a variable in "
"other situations. For example, when setting variables such as "
":term:`FILES` and :term:`RDEPENDS` that are specific to individual "
"packages produced by a recipe, you should always use an override that "
"specifies the name of the package."
