#: ../../dev-manual/new-recipe.rst:1648
msgid ""
"*Indentation:* Use spaces for indentation rather than tabs. For shell "
"functions, both currently work. However, it is a policy decision of the "
"Yocto Project to use tabs in shell functions. Realize that some layers "
