"``libfoo.so``. The :term:`COMPATIBLE_HOST` variable limits recipes to the"
" x86-64 architecture while the :term:`INSANE_SKIP`, "
":term:`INHIBIT_PACKAGE_STRIP` and :term:`INHIBIT_SYSROOT_STRIP` variables"
" are all set as in the above versioned library example. The \"magic\" is "
"setting the :term:`SOLIBS` and :term:`FILES_SOLIBSDEV` variables as "
"explained above::"
